WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.450
- [Interviewer] All right, Ryley.

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.070
Ryley, here are you from
originally, where'd you grow up?

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.363
- I was born in Renton, Washington,

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.660
about 20 minutes outside of Seattle.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:17.493
- [Interviewer] Okay.

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:19.240
And tell me about your family.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:23.470
- My family, my mom was divorced once,

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.580
and then remarried to my dad.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.590
I have two step siblings
a brother and sister,

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.480
and a full sister, I'm the
youngest of all of them.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.930
- [Interviewer] Okay. And
how was your childhood?

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.753
- My childhood was like very
similar to everyone else's.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.053
My parents tried, they put me in sports.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.053
The one thing for me is like,

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.370
I wasn't allowed to have friends over.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:54.500
I didn't have a, like a normal
childhood in that aspect.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.970
Didn't have many friends,
lived down the woods,

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.590
didn't see a lot of people.

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.440
There wasn't a huge like
population in my hometown

00:01:03.440 --> 00:01:04.653
or at my high school.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:11.314
But I spent a lot of time
with probably my sister,

00:01:11.314 --> 00:01:15.253
and one of my really good
friends and playing sports.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.060
- [Interviewer] So, pretty nice childhood

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:20.733
except for a little isolation.

00:01:22.857 --> 00:01:27.590
- As I got older, eight,
nine, 10 closer to my teens,

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.603
I started to realize my dad was,

00:01:30.473 --> 00:01:33.600
what I now know as an alcoholic,

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:38.023
and it was getting
really bad at that time.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:44.200
He wasn't around as
much, he was only around

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:47.430
if it was to force me to
play some kind of sport

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.190
that he wanted me to play, or control me

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.743
in whatever he wanted to do.

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:56.053
And, so it was kinda weird in that aspect.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.740
- [Interviewer] Any abuse
or anything like that?

00:01:59.740 --> 00:02:01.463
- Yeah. Well, of course, yeah.

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.823
Like I said, I wasn't
allowed to have friends over,

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.790
didn't understand that,
so I asked him why.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:13.377
Like 10, I asked my mom
and my mom would be like,

00:02:13.377 --> 00:02:16.947
"It's just your dad's rules,"
and one time I was like,

00:02:16.947 --> 00:02:20.060
"Hey, like why am I not
allowed to have friends over?"

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:23.097
And he just, "Don't ask me
again why you're not allowed

00:02:23.097 --> 00:02:26.577
"to have people over, I don't
like my stuff being stolen

00:02:26.577 --> 00:02:30.080
"or I don't like to have to
watch out for one of you,

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.000
"I would have to look after two of you."

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.677
And I asked him again, he
fucking, he hit me and he said,

00:02:35.677 --> 00:02:37.579
"Shut up, don't ask me again."

00:02:37.579 --> 00:02:38.640
(laughing)

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:41.077
And, so I didn't ask him again (laughing).

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.680
Shit like that, yeah.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.460
He would, I was physically,

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:50.373
mostly verbally abused by him.

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:54.233
- [Interviewer] And you
left home at what age?

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.457
- As soon as I could at 18.

00:02:56.457 --> 00:02:58.640
