00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:05.110
my buddy Connor, we went
to high school together,

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.030
me and a couple other
friends we moved in with him

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:09.640
after his dad was hit and killed

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:14.373
by a inebriated driver
from our school actually.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.463
It was pretty crazy. It was crazy.

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.660
- [Interviewer] And then drugs
came into the picture for you

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:22.890
at what point?
- Then.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:24.350
- Right then?
- Right then.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.670
- Yeah.
- It was just, you know,

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:30.720
partying, weed, fun, parties

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:33.390
