00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:36.523
Actually looking back
on that graduation day,

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:40.350
I'd gotten pretty fucked up, drunk,

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:43.010
pretty drunk and took some pills that day,

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:45.690
and with everyone from graduation.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:47.407
Like, that's not normal,
not everyone did that,

00:03:47.407 --> 00:03:51.320
