Connor who I moved in with,

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:10.830
that was the first time I realized that

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.810
there was a thing called withdrawal.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:16.940
It was the first time I was shown

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.307
what that was, was cause he,
withdrawal, and he was like,

00:04:21.307 --> 00:04:22.670
"I can't do this anymore."

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:27.210
He sat in withdrawed on
his couch, smoked weed,

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:30.145
