00:04:30.145 --> 00:04:32.907
and I was like, "Hmm,
like, I really don't wanna

00:04:32.907 --> 00:04:36.019
"touch that shit again man
if that's what it does."

00:04:36.019 --> 00:04:36.873
It was crazy.

00:04:38.677 --> 00:04:40.180
(gulping)

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:42.300
